+`docs/evidence/TECHNOLOGY-BASELINE-VERIFICATION.md` §10. Feeds
+`docs/compliance/COMPLIANCE-TRACEABILITY-MATRIX.md` (terminology
+licensing row) and `docs/governance/ARCHITECTURE-STATUS.md`.
